# Density Compare
# Zirconium (Zr) — real density 6.52 g/cm³. equal masses: Zirconium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Zirconium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.7mm color: #94e0e0 at (-20mm, 5.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 52.0 g — the water cube is the reference
